    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Start with a fragile ship with a simple weapon.<br></li><li>Defeat ever increasing enemies to gain money.<br></li><li>Spend that money in the shop to purchase various upgrades for your ship.<br></li><li>Roll quests that reward you with bonus money or sometimes even improve your various abilities.<br></li><li>Encounter randomized bosses and defeat them to continue progressing.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 40 unique power-ups<br></li><li>Over 30 enemies types<br></li><li>7 unique bosses<br></li><li>Achievements<br></li><li>Online Leaderboard</li></ul>",
